# ScreenConnect

> ScreenConnect (also known as ConnectWise Control) is a remote support and access software platform built for IT professionals, managed service providers (MSPs), and enterprise IT teams. It enables secure remote desktop access, unattended access, remote meetings, privileged access management (PAM), and mobile device support across Windows, Mac, Linux, iOS, and Android.

ScreenConnect is developed and maintained by ConnectWise. It is available as a cloud-hosted SaaS solution or as an on-premises deployment. Pricing starts at $30/month flat rate. The platform has been in use for over 15 years and holds a 91% user satisfaction rating based on 3,600+ reviews.

